# Minimal pass: the mod, its two hard dependencies (ids in wsl-ids.map) and what they need to load.
# Erin's Rhy'aeth needs Biotech (staged by the script) and Vanilla Expanded Framework; WDI's Realistic Bodies
# declares Female Body Variants. TextureOwner answers which running mod ships a texture; ColonistRace builds the
# Rhy'aeth colonist and fixes its body type.
#
#   Submit-PickleRun.ps1 -Mod RhyaethWdiRealisticBodiesPatch -DepMap wsl-deps.rhyaeth.map -EvidenceDir Tests/Pickle/Inbox/<run>
